          <h4>Google Play Store Compliance Commitment</h4>
          <p>This privacy policy specifically governs the <strong>Kitty App</strong> mobile application published under package ID <code>com.swastikjewel.kittyapp</code> by <strong>Swastik Jewels</strong>. We adhere strictly to the Google Play Developer Program Policies, the Information Technology Act, 2000, and the Digital Personal Data Protection Act (DPDPA), 2023.</p>
