      <section id="section-1" class="kitty-pp-card">
        <h2>1. Introduction & Company Information</h2>
        <p>Welcome to <strong>Kitty App</strong>, the official gold and silver savings and chit accumulation mobile application owned and operated by <strong>Swastik Jewels</strong> ("we," "our," or "us").</p>
        <p>Swastik Jewels is a trusted Indian jewellery establishment with our flagship showroom located at:</p>
        <address class="company-address">
          <strong>Swastik Jewels</strong><br>
          2549, Gali No. 6, Block 35M, Beadonpura,<br>
          Karol Bagh, New Delhi, Delhi &ndash; 110005, India.<br>
          Website: <a href="https://www.swastikjewel.in" target="_blank" rel="noopener">https://www.swastikjewel.in</a><br>
          Official Email: <a href="mailto:contact@swastik.in">contact@swastik.in</a><br>
          Helpline / WhatsApp: <a href="tel:+919671900007">+91 96719 00007</a>
        </address>
        <p>This Privacy Policy describes how we collect, process, store, and safeguard your personal and financial information when you install, register, and use the Kitty App mobile client or access associated backend services.</p>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 2 -->
      <section id="section-2" class="kitty-pp-card">
        <h2>2. Information We Collect</h2>
        <p>We believe in data minimization. We collect only information that is strictly necessary to authenticate your identity, operate your savings schemes, process transactions, and satisfy Indian statutory regulations.</p>

        <h3>A. Information You Provide Directly</h3>
        <ul class="kitty-bullet-list">
          <li><strong>Identity & Profile Information:</strong> Your full name, Indian mobile telephone number (+91), email address, and optional nominee information (nominee name and relationship) required for chit scheme beneficiary records.</li>
          <li><strong>Authentication Credentials:</strong> One-Time Passwords (OTPs) delivered via SMS to verify mobile ownership. We do not use or store static passwords.</li>
          <li><strong>Statutory KYC Verification Data:</strong> Government identity document numbers (Aadhaar or Permanent Account Number [PAN]) and photograph/scan uploads of the physical identity document. This data is collected solely to comply with statutory Anti-Money Laundering (AML) and Prevention of Money Laundering Act (PMLA) guidelines applicable to precious metal transactions in India.</li>
          <li><strong>Doorstep Service Information:</strong> Physical delivery address, landmark, pin code, and preferred collection time slot provided when requesting doorstep cash collection for installment deposits.</li>
        </ul>

        <h3>B. Information Collected Automatically</h3>
        <ul class="kitty-bullet-list">
          <li><strong>Transaction & Ledger Records:</strong> Scheme enrollment details, assigned chit token slots (e.g. 1 to 50), installment schedule, payment due dates, installment payment timestamps, payment status (Initiated, Pending, Completed, Failed), digital receipt PDFs, and accumulated gold/silver ledger balances.</li>
          <li><strong>Network Connectivity State:</strong> We check active network availability (WiFi or Cellular data) via Android's <code>ACCESS_NETWORK_STATE</code> permission to prevent incomplete submissions during offline periods.</li>
          <li><strong>Authentication Session Tokens:</strong> Secure cryptographic JSON Web Tokens (JWT) stored locally on your device in encrypted hardware storage to maintain your logged-in state without re-requesting OTPs on every app launch.</li>
        </ul>

        <h3>C. Information We Do NOT Collect</h3>
        <div class="kitty-pp-highlight-box">
          <p><strong>Zero Ad Tracking & Zero Excessive Permissions:</strong></p>
          <ul>
            <li>We do <strong>not</strong> include any advertising SDKs (no Google AdMob, Facebook Audience Network, or tracking brokers).</li>
            <li>We do <strong>not</strong> collect continuous background GPS location.</li>
            <li>We do <strong>not</strong> access your contacts, SMS inbox, call logs, calendar, or microphone.</li>
            <li>We do <strong>not</strong> capture or store sensitive banking passwords, card CVVs, net banking credentials, or UPI PINs.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 3 -->
      <section id="section-3" class="kitty-pp-card">
        <h2>3. How Information Is Used</h2>
        <p>We use your information strictly for legitimate commercial, operational, and statutory legal purposes:</p>
        <ol class="kitty-numbered-list">
          <li><strong>Account Registration & Authentication:</strong> Verifying mobile ownership via secure SMS OTP and managing your session.</li>
          <li><strong>Chit & Scheme Management:</strong> Managing your selected gold/silver monthly Kitty savings schemes, tracking EMI cycles, allocating dynamic chit token numbers, and updating your live passbook balance.</li>
          <li><strong>Payment Reconciliation:</strong> Generating unique order tokens, verifying payment gateway settlement confirmations, and issuing authenticated, tamper-proof digital PDF receipts.</li>
          <li><strong>Doorstep Cash Collection:</strong> Facilitating authorized Swastik representative doorstep collection when chosen by patrons.</li>
          <li><strong>Statutory KYC & AML Compliance:</strong> Fulfilling government-mandated customer identification for high-value precious metals transactions under the Prevention of Money Laundering Act, 2002.</li>
          <li><strong>Customer Support & Notices:</strong> Sending critical account alerts, payment receipts, due date reminders, and responding to support queries.</li>
        </ol>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 4 -->
      <section id="section-4" class="kitty-pp-card">
        <h2>4. Authentication & Account Security</h2>
        <p>Account security in the Kitty App is designed with bank-grade defense mechanisms:</p>
        <ul class="kitty-bullet-list">
          <li><strong>Passwordless OTP Verification:</strong> Primary mobile login relies on dynamic 6-digit OTPs with a 30-second resend throttle and a 300-second strict Time-To-Live (TTL).</li>
          <li><strong>Google Sign-In:</strong> When selecting Google Sign-In, authentication is delegated securely to Google Play Services using OAuth 2.0. We only receive verified token identifiers, name, and email. Your Google account password is never accessible to us.</li>
          <li><strong>Biometric App Unlock:</strong> The app supports optional biometric unlock (fingerprint or facial authentication) using Android's <code>USE_BIOMETRIC</code> and <code>USE_FINGERPRINT</code> APIs via <code>local_auth</code>. All biometric data remains exclusively processed on your device's secure enclave and is never transmitted to our servers.</li>
          <li><strong>Hardware-Backed Token Encryption:</strong> Session tokens are stored using <code>FlutterSecureStorage</code>, which utilizes the <strong>Android KeyStore</strong> system with AES-256 and EncryptedSharedPreferences.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 5 -->
      <section id="section-5" class="kitty-pp-card">
        <h2>5. Kitty Schemes & Financial Transaction Records</h2>
        <p>Patrons enrolled in Swastik Kitty schemes participate in recurring gold accumulation plans. To protect your financial rights and provide absolute transparency:</p>
        <ul class="kitty-bullet-list">
          <li>Every installment paid generates an immutable transaction log containing the payment reference, date, amount, installment month number, and digital signature.</li>
          <li>Your digital passbook displays live accumulated gold grams calculated based on the transparent daily prevailing bullion rate.</li>
          <li>PDF payment receipts are generated upon webhook reconciliation and stored for your on-demand download.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 6 -->
      <section id="section-6" class="kitty-pp-card">
        <h2>6. Payment Processing Through GoKwik</h2>
        <p>All digital payments within the Kitty App are processed through <strong>GoKwik</strong> (GoKwik Commerce Solutions Pvt. Ltd.), an authorized and RBI-compliant payment aggregator:</p>
        <ul class="kitty-bullet-list">
          <li><strong>Server-to-Server Proxy Architecture:</strong> The Kitty App client never holds merchant secret keys or payment processing private credentials. The app requests a payment session from the Swastik backend, which communicates with GoKwik over TLS 1.3 encrypted channels.</li>
          <li><strong>Supported Payment Modes:</strong> UPI (Google Pay, PhonePe, Paytm, BHIM), Net Banking, Debit Cards, and Credit Cards.</li>
          <li><strong>PCI-DSS Compliance:</strong> All card and banking transactions are processed on GoKwik's PCI-DSS Level 1 certified infrastructure. Swastik Jewels never views, processes, or stores your 16-digit card numbers, CVVs, or UPI MPINs.</li>
          <li><strong>Reconciliation via Webhooks:</strong> Payment status is verified through secure, cryptographically signed webhooks dispatched directly between GoKwik and the Swastik server infrastructure.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 7 -->
      <section id="section-7" class="kitty-pp-card">
        <h2>7. Data Sharing & Third-Party Service Providers</h2>
        <p><strong>We do not sell, rent, monetize, or trade your personal data.</strong> Your data is shared solely with trusted service providers strictly to perform operational functions:</p>

