      <!-- Section 9 -->
      <section id="section-9" class="kitty-pp-card">
        <h2>9. Data Retention Policy</h2>
        <p>We retain personal and financial records only for as long as necessary to fulfill the purposes for which they were collected:</p>
        <ul class="kitty-bullet-list">
          <li><strong>Active Scheme Duration:</strong> Account profile and active scheme enrollment data are retained throughout the tenure of your savings plan.</li>
          <li><strong>Statutory Financial & Tax Mandate:</strong> Under the Indian Companies Act, 2013 and the Income Tax Act, 1961, books of account, payment invoices, and transaction vouchers must be preserved for a minimum of <strong>eight (8) consecutive financial years</strong>.</li>
          <li><strong>Statutory KYC Documents:</strong> KYC verification files are retained in compliance with Prevention of Money Laundering Act (PMLA) requirements for customer due diligence.</li>
          <li><strong>Session Data:</strong> Temporary device tokens and in-memory caches are purged immediately upon logout.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 10 -->
