        <h2>10. Account Deletion & Personal Data Deletion</h2>
        <p>In full compliance with Google Play's Account Deletion Policy, patrons have the unequivocal right to request the complete deletion of their account and associated personal data.</p>

        <div class="kitty-pp-deletion-card">
          <h3>How to Request Account & Data Deletion</h3>
          <p>You can request deletion through either of the following straightforward channels without requiring app login:</p>
          
          <div class="deletion-steps">
            <div class="step-box">
              <span class="step-num">Option 1</span>
              <h4>Email Deletion Request</h4>
              <p>Send an email from your registered email address or mentioning your registered mobile number to:</p>
              <p><a href="mailto:contact@swastik.in?subject=Kitty%20App%20Account%20Deletion%20Request&body=Hello%20Swastik%20Jewels,%0A%0APlease%20permanently%20delete%20my%20Kitty%20App%20account%20and%20associated%20data.%0A%0ARegistered%20Mobile%20Number:%20%0AFull%20Name:%20" class="kitty-btn-primary">Email Deletion Request (contact@swastik.in)</a></p>
            </div>

            <div class="step-box">
              <span class="step-num">Option 2</span>
              <h4>Web Deletion Form</h4>
              <p>Submit your request through our official store contact portal at <a href="https://www.swastikjewel.in/pages/contact" target="_blank" rel="noopener">swastikjewel.in/pages/contact</a> specifying "Account Deletion Request".</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <h4>What Happens When Deletion is Requested?</h4>
          <ul class="kitty-bullet-list">
            <li><strong>Verification:</strong> Our compliance team verifies the request via an SMS OTP confirmation sent to your registered mobile number to prevent unauthorized deletions.</li>
            <li><strong>Data Deleted:</strong> Your profile credentials, stored names, login tokens, marketing preferences, and uploaded KYC document images will be permanently erased or anonymized from active operational databases within <strong>30 calendar days</strong>.</li>
            <li><strong>Data Retained:</strong> Where you have concluded financial chit schemes, statutory purchase invoices and tax records must be retained in accordance with mandatory Indian taxation and financial audit laws as outlined in Section 9.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 11 -->
      <section id="section-11" class="kitty-pp-card">
        <h2>11. Patron Rights & Choices</h2>
        <p>Under the Digital Personal Data Protection Act (DPDPA), 2023, you enjoy comprehensive rights concerning your personal information:</p>
        <ul class="kitty-bullet-list">
          <li><strong>Right to Access & Review:</strong> View your active schemes, past payments, and passbook balances anytime within the application.</li>
          <li><strong>Right to Rectification:</strong> Update or correct inaccurate personal details by contacting our support desk.</li>
          <li><strong>Right to Withdraw Consent:</strong> You may revoke consent for optional features at any time. Revoking consent for mandatory KYC or transactional services will terminate scheme eligibility.</li>
          <li><strong>Right of Grievance Redressal:</strong> Direct escalation of complaints to our designated Grievance Officer as provided in Section 15.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 12 -->
      <section id="section-12" class="kitty-pp-card">
        <h2>12. Children's Privacy</h2>
        <p>The Kitty App and associated jewellery savings schemes are exclusively intended for adult patrons who are at least <strong>18 years of age</strong> and legally capable of entering into binding contracts under the Indian Contract Act, 1872.</p>
        <p>We do not knowingly solicit, collect, or store personal data from minors under the age of 18. If we discover that personal information of a minor has been mistakenly collected, it will be deleted immediately from our systems.</p>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 13 -->
      <section id="section-13" class="kitty-pp-card">
        <h2>13. International & Cross-Border Data Transfers</h2>
        <p>All primary databases, payment reconciliations, and server infrastructure are hosted and processed within India in full compliance with local regulatory data residency standards. Certain global cloud service providers (such as Google and Cloudinary) may utilize secure overseas cloud infrastructure operating under strict confidentiality and encryption agreements matching Indian data protection laws.</p>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 14 -->
      <section id="section-14" class="kitty-pp-card">
        <h2>14. Changes to This Privacy Policy</h2>
        <p>We may update this Privacy Policy periodically to reflect enhancements in the Kitty App, evolving operational practices, or amendments to applicable regulations. When changes are published, the "Last Updated" date at the top of this document will be revised.</p>
        <p>For material changes that affect your rights or data processing scope, we will provide prominent notification through in-app alerts or registered SMS notifications.</p>
      </section>

